  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-tiny-tomatoes-v5-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "017f6a42dc489b0ba1eb136a0f03485c86882773b8b029d3ab445b8e00a6f225",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "95e324f856b77dac41616b05fc90bc4b36a897066802f7223dc06a5c1917f96f",
      "text": "悟空的\n小番茄",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "111f9b49a7c0353dfa80f16f72edc3230c351bd6b2e71664de213c09916eacc0",
      "text": "悟空家门口，\n有块阳光暖暖的小空地。\n“我们来种小番茄吧！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f33b84d1882d8cff28d11ad3e905c563d277e478f2dbf7dbee1ee4c9bdacc98b",
      "text": "敖丙带来两棵小苗。\n他们挖了两个小坑。\n“你种一棵，我种一棵！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ee0fa80ae306f54a0456fa915f7419e541f9f9c46a9b61fdd82fc8eaf71f839e",
      "text": "把小苗放进坑里，\n拍拍，拍拍，把土盖好。\n悟空也拍拍自己的小肚子。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "41b31ac01d2d5f5f4fd11ba2ce1c5300f21eff3312ea6af69c2a2b8bdd995502",
      "text": "悟空把小水壶一歪。\n“请你喝水……”\n哎呀！水浇到了鞋子上！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "036527821ac59907789441c909cc079a799da0bd37e5823f4ce9943dfb60ff54",
      "text": "敖丙变出一朵小云。\n滴答，滴答，滴答。\n“温柔的小雨！”悟空说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5e56f7dc3e5aeb86f5b1490066bf4d89246f6ef6e039bb3d20a73c5b8905c743",
      "text": "每天，他们都摸摸泥土。\n土干了？浇一点水。\n土湿湿的？放心去玩吧！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3745534067ca4686db345ce3247946bead583b725f86a152cdd2e001f61fd92a",
      "text": "“红了吗？”悟空问。\n他在每片叶子下面找呀找。\n敖丙指指他的小鼻子，笑了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bf6c64f3bd7bfbe231c204f9eab2b5a1bc5b82d1ca85026471222404247b2d4e",
      "text": "一天天过去了。\n小黄花开了。\n“你好呀，小星星！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1cc5ff8aef0121fe98eedb53284e7e39392127e9277eb6c58c56481cc1af090a",
      "text": "接着，长出绿绿的小番茄。\n“熟了吗？”悟空问。\n“还没有呢。”敖丙说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a11e734454182241394450c538916d9cb5c3284f89813c2af62ffd4608edc34b",
      "text": "悟空小声说：\n“请变红吧。”\n番茄静悄悄的，\n一声也不吭。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5c99faf933b97395c3b8d36f212a23573db1c84b2d7a40bbc22feeca703fbe22",
      "text": "浇浇水，等一等。\n绿色变成金色，\n金色变成橙色。\n“快好了！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "88135009fb5de8be4916795eb536d78a9f47616d783748408049a5753f31cf4f",
      "text": "一天早上……红了！\n亮亮的，番茄红！\n悟空跳起了小番茄舞。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "28983b0b2faee956abbe1d33e889c7fc8740610633e8a1dab51ffa4ffaabacc6",
      "text": "轻轻一拧，往上一提。\n红番茄摘下来啦！\n绿番茄留着继续长。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "882ee5f31d58ff55261c761214a976c1aa976697622b6f7af3cdfa85b01330b3",
      "text": "他们洗净刚摘的小番茄。\n红红的番茄，凉凉的水。\n“现在可以尝尝啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ebf79572abf13b1e8401d72551af56ad91ab0ac3b506f0f138226c070561e67d",
      "text": "他们分享甜甜的番茄。\n“这是我们种的！”悟空说。\n敖丙笑了：“我们一起种的。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ec8d2925b34f65683b4ac3a96f4d0a62c5669ce90c16387e750248f64252ac20",
